[ar:Dept]
[ti:When It Rains]
[by:netease]
[00:00.00]作词 : 16/Dept
[00:01.00]作曲 : 16/Dept/neeve
[00:12.48]Lying on the bed, same old day
[00:12.48]躺在床上 一如往常
[00:15.06]Then I'm hearing the falling rain
[00:15.06]耳畔传来淅沥雨声
[00:19.15]Reminds me of you and I
[00:19.15]忆起你曾与我相伴
[00:22.74]We used to just keep walking in the pouring rain
[00:22.74]行走于倾盆大雨之中
[00:27.25]I liked the way you saw things
[00:27.25]我喜欢你看事情的方式
[00:31.77]so warm and bright
[00:31.77]如此温暖而明亮
[00:34.16]And dry up my soggy mind
[00:34.16]驱散我潮湿的心绪
[00:38.28]When it rains it sounds like you
[00:38.28]雨落下时 一如你的声音
[00:42.18]It comes right through my heart like you
[00:42.18]如你一般穿透我的心房
[00:46.33]And sometimes I feel alone in the rain
[00:46.33]有时我在雨中感到孤单
[00:50.93]But it's alright
[00:50.93]然而无妨
[00:52.94]Cuz it sounds like you, it sounds like
[00:52.94]因为雨听起来就像你 它如此动听
